      "label": "Abstract",
      "value": [
        "Broadside: Temperance Hall, Horsedge street, Oldham. For a short time only, commencing Sunday, Oct. 16th, 1892: Herr Cohen, the celebrated phrenologist and medical electrician, will give a series of highly popular lecture entertainments entitled-sketches from life & character. Banner: Herr Cohen to-night at 8."
